1 && then call: ~a t y after |
2 || then call: ~b t y after |
3 concat then call: ~c f xscf after |
4 concat chain: ~d f f xysdff after |
5 first two of chain: f ~e f seff after |
6 cast in concat: ~g f sgf after |
7 static call echoes: ~i sm sm after |
8 instanceof class expr: f ~j n after |
9 fetch then method: ~k mk2 ~k2 k2 after |
10 fetch then fetch: ~l ~l2 l2 after |
11 fetch then call arg: ~o ~o2 f 3 after |
12 match arm calls: f ~q f after |
13 nullsafe then call: mr ~r f rf after |
14 nullsafe fetch: ~s ms2 ~s2 s2 after |
15 coalesce then call: ~u f f after |
16 coalesce magic: issetv getv ~v f f after |
17 isset nested magic: ~w issetw2 ~w2 y after |
18 builtin array arg then call: ~x f f after |
19 builtin array arg nested: ~y f 2 after |
20 array cast foreach: body loop ~z after |
21 array cast of object: ~aa f 4f after |
22 class const then call: ~ab f cf after |
23 static prop then call: ~ac f spf after |
24 class name then call: ~ad f Df after |
25 ternary cond then call: ~ae f f after |
26 if cond then body: ~af f after |
27 while cond: ~ag0 f ~ag1 after |
28 xor: t ~ah n after |
29 not then call: ~ai f f after |
30 binary op then call: ~aj f f after |
31 method result then call: mak ~ak f akf after |
32 array_values result: set ~al after |
33 return of temp prop: ~am got ~am2 after |
end
